# 小屏, a finger, on the workspace of real size over a late core (src/sfbench/switch_scene.mbt): the workspaces' sheet
# opened by the switcher, then closed by a press outside it, measured from that press: the sheet closing, nothing
# picked.
timeout 20000
until 星火工作室
wait 1500
tap1 星火工作室
wait 700
log measure
tapxy 195 60
wait 900
exit
